```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Bangalore - The Silicon Valley of India</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#f4f7fa;
    color:#333;
    line-height:1.6;
}

header{
    background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.5),rgba(0,0,0,0.5)),
    url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588416499018-d4f3f4b5db89?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80');
    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center;
    height:100vh;
    color:white;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:4rem;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.hero p{
    font-size:1.3rem;
    max-width:700px;
    margin:auto;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:20px;
    padding:12px 25px;
    background:#00b894;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:30px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

section{
    padding:70px 10%;
}

.section-title{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:40px;
    font-size:2.5rem;
    color:#2d3436;
}

.cards{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
    gap:25px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    border-radius:15px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    transition:0.3s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.card img{
    width:100%;
    height:220px;
    object-fit:cover;
}

.card-content{
    padding:20px;
}

.card h3{
    margin-bottom:10px;
    color:#0984e3;
}

.tech{
    background:#0f172a;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
}

.tech h2{
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.tech p{
    max-width:800px;
    margin:auto;
    font-size:1.1rem;
}

.stats{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:40px;
    margin-top:40px;
}

.stat{
    background:#1e293b;
    padding:25px;
    border-radius:12px;
    min-width:180px;
}

.stat h3{
    font-size:2rem;
    color:#00d4ff;
}

footer{
    background:#111827;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Bangalore</h1>
        <p>The Garden City & Silicon Valley of India — where innovation meets culture.</p>
        <a href="#places" class="btn">Explore Bangalore</a>
    </div>
</header>

<section id="places">
    <h2 class="section-title">Famous Places</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593696140826-c58b021acf8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Lalbagh Botanical Garden</h3>
                <p>One of India's most beautiful botanical gardens with over 1,800 species of plants.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585136917228-6f3f83f3f6a0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Bangalore Palace</h3>
                <p>A stunning royal palace inspired by England's Windsor Castle.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512453979798-5ea266f8880c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Cubbon Park</h3>
                <p>A green oasis in the heart of the city, perfect for walks and relaxation.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Food & Culture</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Masala Dosa</h3>
                <p>Bangalore is famous for its crispy dosas served with chutney and sambar.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Filter Coffee</h3>
                <p>A rich and aromatic South Indian coffee enjoyed across the city.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Kannada Heritage</h3>
                <p>The city blends traditional Karnataka culture with a modern cosmopolitan lifestyle.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section class="tech">
    <h2>India's Technology Capital</h2>

    <p>
        Bangalore is home to thousands of startups, global technology companies,
        innovation hubs, and research centers. It is widely known as the
        "Silicon Valley of India".
    </p>

    <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
            <h3>12M+</h3>
            <p>Population</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat">
            <h3>5000+</h3>
            <p>Startups</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat">
            <h3>1000+</h3>
            <p>Tech Companies</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Bangalore Tourism | Designed with ❤️</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
```
